{"4991550": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Shady O'Grady's™ Rising Star (2007)", "steam_appid": 4991550, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Originally released in 2007, Shady O'Grady's™ Rising Star is now available on Steam as a convenience to players that have wondered how to get ahold of the game that started it all.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build a band, write songs, practice, buy equipment, level up, play gigs, become part of your local music scene, get a manager, get a recording contract, record albums, go on tour. If you're not familiar with Rising Star 2, you should also check out that game, which is a much more modern version of this one.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >IMPORTANT!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a retro game that was designed when 32-bit Windows XP was current, and may have performance issues on some newer systems. Don't buy this game unless you're looking for an old-school gaming experience or you want to support Gilligames in general. Rising Star 2 is recommended if you are only looking for a band management game.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Anti-Virus False Positive</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some anti-virus programs will falsely flag older games built in BlitzBasic or Blitz3D as viruses. If you experience this, you will have to add the Band_Game.exe as an exception or disable realtime virus checking when playing.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Originally released in 2007, Shady O'Grady's™ Rising Star is now available on Steam as a convenience to players that have wondered how to get ahold of the game that started it all.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build a band, write songs, practice, buy equipment, level up, play gigs, become part of your local music scene, get a manager, get a recording contract, record albums, go on tour. If you're not familiar with Rising Star 2, you should also check out that game, which is a much more modern version of this one.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >IMPORTANT!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a retro game that was designed when 32-bit Windows XP was current, and may have performance issues on some newer systems. Don't buy this game unless you're looking for an old-school gaming experience or you want to support Gilligames in general. Rising Star 2 is recommended if you are only looking for a band management game.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Anti-Virus False Positive</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some anti-virus programs will falsely flag older games built in BlitzBasic or Blitz3D as viruses. If you experience this, you will have to add the Band_Game.exe as an exception or disable realtime virus checking when playing.</p>", "short_description": "Build a band, write songs, practice, buy equipment, level up, play gigs, become part of your local music scene, get a manager, get a recording contract, record albums, go on tour. This is the predecessor to Rising Star 2.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4991550/17be3cf97e77dfcdf3fcc36a75a1c5e7333f1993/header.jpg?t=1786986063", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4991550/430a26956db5b219a5d04ff9909f03850326161c/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1786986063", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4991550/430a26956db5b219a5d04ff9909f03850326161c/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1786986063", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS *:</strong> Windows XP<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 2007<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> 2007<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 7.0<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 360 MB available space<br></li><li><strong>Sound Card:</st